  intro Ω _ _ W hW hWt X uX ι hM x τ hτ hw σ σ' b c hPb hP'b hb hc0 hcm X' r ι' hbl hι' hM'
    X₁ r₁ ι₁ hbl₁ hι₁ hM₁ σ₁ hσ₁ X'' r'' ι'' hbl'' hι'' hM''
